            "heading": "Advanced Training We Draw From",
            "content": "<p>Our work integrates EMDR, somatic psychology, Internal Family Systems, DBT, ACT, ecotherapy, and mindfulness-based frameworks. See the full list of certifications and advanced training behind our care.</p>",
            "image_alt": "",
